	(gr_text "Just an idea in progress to use a steel EMI/RF shield\nto try to protect the MRAM from magnetic fields.\nUnknown how much this kind of shield would actually help.\nThe shield is thin steel, when what you want is thick mumetal.\n\nSet  mram_shield = true;  in WP-2_Card_Cover.scad"
